   "en": "But the queen had long since been wounded by a deep anxiety; she feeds the wound in her veins, and is consumed by a fire she cannot see. Again and again his courage comes back to her mind, again and again the honour of his line; his face, his words, stay fixed in her heart, and her love allows her limbs no peaceful rest.",
