   "en": "The next dawn was lighting the earth with Phoebus's lamp, and had cleared the dewy shadow from the sky, when, hardly herself, she spoke to her sister, who shared her every thought: 'Anna, my sister, what dreams keep me in such suspense, and terrify me!",
