  {
   "id": 3,
   "ref": "10–14",
   "en": "What a [stranger|2,7] this is who has come to stay in our home — how noble his [bearing|10,11], how brave his heart, how strong in arms! I really do believe — and it is no idle faith — that his family is divine. Fear betrays a coward's spirit. Ah, what fates he has been driven through! What wars he told of, and endured to the end!'",
